# thredUP
> thredUP is the world's largest online resale and consignment platform for secondhand
> women's and kids' clothing, shoes, and accessories. Founded in 2009 and
> headquartered in Oakland, CA, thredUP makes it easy and affordable to buy and sell
> pre-owned fashion, helping extend the life of clothing and reduce fashion waste.

